  "plain": "A doctor named Cesario, who treated a Varginha soldier named Marco Chereze in 1996 after Chereze is said to have handled the creature, says he gave him every antibiotic he could and they should have saved his life, but they did nothing. The documentary filmmaker James Fox tells Michels what Cesario told him. If true, the infection that killed Chereze would have been something ordinary medicine could not touch."
